<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, OCT 9.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, OCT 9.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Wednesday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:	Oct 9	 Oct 8	 DEC 29 95    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  240.100     239.800     237.040    1.29 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  300.500     300.600     303.640   -1.03 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  156.855     157.200     165.490   -5.22 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.404	46.484	48.410   -4.14 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  375.600     374.220     366.280    2.54 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  139.825     140.085     147.886   -5.45 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   15.798	15.798	14.975    5.50 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  215.250     215.660     230.135   -6.47 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.867	 1.869	 1.939   -3.71 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.554	 1.555	 1.575   -1.33 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  191.195     192.125     206.030   -7.20 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>29, 1995 rate.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
